{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/4010a03608e048d3b389723911b85b0a.poster.avif?t=1771637752\" width=614 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/4010a03608e048d3b389723911b85b0a.webm?t=1771637752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your sawed-off, cast some sigils, and face the never ending nightmare head on in <strong>Venison County</strong>. Blast your old neighbors into undead venison giblets, master weapon specific active reloads, and limitlessly combine slain cultists' sigils for their sinful buffs (if you can withstand God's wrath).  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/626e3f5d950baea4b77e54d6d64fdfae.poster.avif?t=1771637752\" width=614 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/626e3f5d950baea4b77e54d6d64fdfae.webm?t=1771637752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine Sigils Endlessly.</strong>\u00a0Turn all your guns into shotguns and let God sort them out with exploding bullets, grant yourself night vision and pick enemies off from afar with extreme bullet velocity, spray and pray with\u00a0fervorous attack speed and doubled magazine capacity, or get medieval on some zombie ass with swift movement and insta-gib pitchfork parries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/0ae8ac5b545d422fb358210531ad7215.poster.avif?t=1771637752\" width=614 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/0ae8ac5b545d422fb358210531ad7215.webm?t=1771637752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Reload Sequence for Each Gun.</strong>\u00a0Master each of 8 different guns' respective reloads. Wait for a breather and reload them at your own pace, or reload mid-battle and risk dropping precious ammo or being overwhelmed. With each sequence having unique pacing, difficulty, and sound effects, a gun's reload is as distinctive as its shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/0247c9d0d41a019c0cc61d35bd4a5ade.poster.avif?t=1771637752\" width=614 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/0247c9d0d41a019c0cc61d35bd4a5ade.webm?t=1771637752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wade in the Blood of an Endless Onslaught.</strong>\u00a0Every new day comes with a dynamically curated onslaught of enemies. They wont coming stop until you die. Climb the ranks of a global leaderboard (not included in the playtest) to see who can cause the most carnage, and soak the earth in blood and gibs inspired by retro gorefest classics such as <i>Blood</i> 1997 and <i>Quake</i>\u00a01996.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/ed6c4f0c74d66fcf6da5b990b6586067.webp?t=1771637752\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/ed6c4f0c74d66fcf6da5b990b6586067.poster.avif?t=1771637752\" class=\"bb_img\" width=488 height=93 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a credited playtester, receive frequent development updates, and chat with the developers and a community of over 100 Venison County fans at the Venison County Discord server, linked in the sidebar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/2df811eb619b38ccc0705570dcfdf372.poster.avif?t=1771637752\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/2df811eb619b38ccc0705570dcfdf372.webm?t=1771637752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868900?t=1771637752","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/6d3e35777a89ae79fbdebc07b164a6dbfbaa1d36/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771637752","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/1e3a86103c300fb57ece1b454af3b7bb8e3fa826/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771637752","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/1e3a86103c300fb57ece1b454af3b7bb8e3fa826/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771637752","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Frequent depictions of stylized/retro blood and gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/4010a03608e0